-11-21T08:55:00.000Z","status":"resolved","details":"Data loss due to bybit WS API returning error message when trying to subscribing to their liquidation feed that subsequently resulted in IP rate limit ban."},{"from":"2025-10-10T21:15:00.000Z","to":"2025-10-10T21:22:00.000Z","status":"resolved","details":"Data loss occurred due to a surge of incoming data that exceeded the processing capacity of our infrastructure at that time."},{"from":"2025-09-22T06:00:00.000Z","to":"2025-09-22T06:17:00.000Z","status":"resolved","details":"Data loss occurred due to a surge of incoming data that exceeded the processing capacity of our infrastructure at that time."},{"from":"2025-08-14T12:30:00.000Z","to":"2025-08-14T12:50:00.000Z","status":"resolved","details":"Data loss occurred due to a surge of incoming data that exceeded the processing capacity of our infrastructure at that time."},{"from":"2023-04-19T08:23:00.000Z","to":"2023-04-19T09:00:00.000Z","status":"resolved","details":"Missing orderbook.1, orderbook.50, and publicTrade data during a Bybit WebSocket reconnect storm. Recorder logs show repeated upstream WebSocket HTTP 403 responses; normal recording resumed at 09:00 UTC."},{"from":"2023-04-05T00:00:00.000Z","to":"2023-04-05T05:50:00.000Z","status":"resolved","details":"Missing feed data due to deployment bug that was introduced when switching to Bybit API v5."},{"from":"2023-04-01T00:00:00.000Z","to":"2023-04-11T00:00:00.000Z","status":"resolved","details":"Missing v2/ticker channel data due to internal bug."},{"from":"2021-05-12T07:02:00.000Z","to":"2021-05-12T07:42:00.000Z","status":"resolved","details":"GKE node network issue resulted triggering auto-repair logic and missing data in that period."},{"from":"2021-03-05T14:14:00.000Z","to":"2021-03-05T14:23:00.000Z","status":"resolved","details":"Missing data due to virtual machine crash. Crash was caused by hardware issue on the physical machine hosting VM which has been automatically replaced with healthy one by auto-repair logic."},{"from":"2020-06-28T16:13:00.000Z","to":"2020-06-28T16:20:00.000Z","status":"resolved","details":"Intermittent AWS CloudFront connection issues caused increased disconnections and establishing connection timeouts that resulted in missing data."},{"from":"2020-06-11T18:32:00.000Z","to":"2020-06-11T19:55:00.000Z","status":"resolved","details":"Intermittent Kubernetes Node network issue caused increased disconnections count and establishing connection timeouts that resulted in missing data."},{"from":"2020-05-28T16:14:56.000Z","to":"2020-05-28T16:15:04.000Z","status":"resolved","details":"Missing data (~8 seconds) caused by moving Bybit data collection infrastructure from London to Tokyo GKE cluster."}]}